    lineCount: 5,
    bodyC: "if (!IsEasyChatGroupUnlocked(groupId))\n        return EC_EMPTY_WORD;\n\n    if (groupId == EC_GROUP_POKEMON)\n        return GetRandomUnlockedEasyChatPokemon();\n\n    return GetRandomEasyChatWordFromGroup(groupId);",
